
Reevit setup

Found Next.js · TypeScript · App Router · pnpm

Dry run — would do the following:
  • pnpm add @reevit/node
    install the SDK selected for this project
  • create or reuse scoped project test credentials
    keep the account login credential out of application code
  • ensure the sandbox simulator is ready
    make the generated integration testable immediately
  + .env.local and .env.example
    wire separate server, browser, organization, and webhook values
  + app/api/webhooks/reevit/route.ts
    Webhook handler (app/api/webhooks/reevit)
  • verify the generated project credentials against the sandbox
    do not report success until the platform accepts the new credentials
